  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-04-17T12:30:00-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 17, 2021, 12:30 pm\">April 17, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"em em-view-container\" id=\"em-view-6\">\n\t<div class=\"em pixelbones em-item em-item-single em-event em-event-single em-event-248 \" id=\"em-event-6\">\n\t\t<div></div>\n<p>\n\t<strong>Date/Time</strong><br />\n\tDate(s) - 04/17/2021<br /><i>12:30 pm - 2:00 pm</i>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Categories</strong>\n\t\t</p><ul class=\"event-categories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-b60c1aac0c9d855e2263/\">The Art Gallery</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\n<p></p>\n<br />\n<p>Members of the Art Gallery meet monthly to review operational procedures, discuss the status of the Art Gallery, attend to business obligations, and coordinate seasonal promotions and activities. Due to COVID-19, upcoming Art Gallery Meetings are being held via Zoom, unless otherwise noted. Instructions on how to easily join the Art Gallery meetings via Zoom (no registration required) will be sent via email one day prior to the meeting.</p>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
